    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"Tapper_Description","source":"Place on a maple, oak, or pine tree and wait for the reservoir to fill with product!","translation":"裝在楓樹、橡樹或松樹上，等待容器裝滿產物！"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"TeddyTimer_Name","source":"Teddy Timer","translation":"泰迪計時鐘"},
