    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"TuboFlowers_Name","source":"Tub o' Flowers","translation":"一桶花"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"TuboFlowers_Description","source":"Flowers planted in an oak barrel. Blooms in spring and summer.","translation":"種在橡木桶裡的花朵。於春季和夏季綻放。"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"WickedStatue_Name","source":"Wicked Statue","translation":"邪惡雕像"},
